# The Ring's level 1 (Player.setRingLevel): "Your Ring-bearer can't be
# blocked by creatures with greater power" -- Mode$ CantBlockBy with
# ValidBlockerRelative$ Creature.powerGTX, X = Count$CardPower, the
# attacker's power. The Ring-bearer Grizzly Bears (2/2) attacks; the AI
# declares both Hill Giant (3/3) and its own Grizzly Bears (2/2) as
# blockers. Hill Giant's block is illegal and dropped (CanBlock); the
# equal-power Bears' block stands: each Bears takes 2 damage, and the
# Hill Giant none.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1,3=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
